            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elizabeth B-Koch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was delighted to find this recipe! My Grandma, who passed away 4 years ago, always made these. The recipe has been misplaced since she passed, and I couldn't find it anywhere. These cookies tend to be a bit dry, but overall they have a nice twist of crunch &amp; chewy, with the combination of cornflakes and fruits. I like to add a handful of candied fruits to them (besides the cherries the recipe calls for) to help them not be quite so dry.",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-08T11:37:07.433Z"
          },
